<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Opus transferred to JSE Industrial section.</title>
<headline>Opus transferred to JSE Industrial section.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opus Investments Ltd advised shareholders that its ordinary shares of one cent each had been transferred to the Industrials-&quot;Beverages, Hotels and Leisure&quot; section of the Johannesburg Stock Exchange with effect from the commencement of business on Monday.</p>
<p>Opus was previously listed under the Financial-&quot;Investments Trusts&quot; section.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
